## Journals
- Implements [v1.0 Errata](https://media.dndbeyond.com/compendium-images/errata/DMG-24/DMG-24_v1.pdf) updates in journals. [#1222](https://github.com/foundryvtt/foundryvtt-premium-content/issues/1222)
- Corrects a typo in Chapter 2's Art Handouts journal. It now reads "In a courtyard full of monsters…" from "Ina courtyard full of monsters… ." [#1108](https://github.com/foundryvtt/foundryvtt-premium-content/issues/1108)
- Adds the missing word (**bolded**) to the first sentence in the City Overview sub-section of the Free City of Grayhawk section: "The city is yours to make your own. A few important features and locations are described in the **sections** that follow… ." [#1120](https://github.com/foundryvtt/foundryvtt-premium-content/issues/1120)

### AppV2 Journals
- Updates module journal classes to use the system's AppV2 classes.
- Fully supports color scheme settings, including Table of Contents app (controlled by 'Interface' theme, currently).
- Corrects "hide in embed" CSS class. [#1350](https://github.com/foundryvtt/foundryvtt-premium-content/issues/1350)

## Equipment and Magic Items
- Updates the rarity for Heward's Hand Haversack, Bag of Holding, and other magic items that were missing their rarity. [#1211](https://github.com/foundryvtt/foundryvtt-premium-content/issues/1211)

### Rod of Alertness
- Renames "Plant Rod" activity to "Protective Aura" to directly associate it with the item's text.
- Adds Active Effect granting advantage on perception and initiative checks. [#1341](https://github.com/foundryvtt/foundryvtt-premium-content/issues/1341)

### Quiver of Ehlonna
- Corrects internal containers (long, short, and midsize compartment) to have Item Count limits of 6, 60, and 18, respectively. [#1253](https://github.com/foundryvtt/foundryvtt-premium-content/issues/1253)

### Boots of Speed
- Updates activation for Boots of Speed to Bonus Action from Action. [#1243](https://github.com/foundryvtt/foundryvtt-premium-content/issues/1243)

### Boots of Elvenkind
- Adds Active Effect with stealth advantage changes.

### Cloak of the Bat
- Adds Active Effect with stealth advantage changes.

### Vicious Weapon
- Updates the enchantment attribute of the Vicious Weapon to `system.damage.parts | Add | [["2d6"]]`, enabling the additional damage dice to appear in the roll formula. [#1161](https://github.com/foundryvtt/foundryvtt-premium-content/issues/1161)

### Ioun Stones
- Corrects a mispelling in the Ioun Stone of Regeneration and Ioun Stone items (now "Regeneration" from "Regneration"). [#1205](https://github.com/foundryvtt/foundryvtt-premium-content/issues/1205)

### Rod of Lordly Might
- Attunement is unchecked in the Details tab for Rod of Lordly Might and the Rod of Rulership. [#1241](https://github.com/foundryvtt/foundryvtt-premium-content/issues/1241)

### Scroll of Tital Summoning
- Animal Lord, Blob of Annihilation, Elemental Cataclysm, Empyrean, Kraken, and Larva are now referenced in the module's redirects file. The empty NPCs will need to remain so the module has something to redirect from. [#1345](https://github.com/foundryvtt/foundryvtt-premium-content/issues/1345)

### Consumables
- Changes the activation of all potions to a bonus action. [#1140](https://github.com/foundryvtt/foundryvtt-premium-content/issues/1140)
- Potion of Healing (Greater)
  - Corrects Destory on Empty setting. [#1295](https://github.com/foundryvtt/foundryvtt-premium-content/issues/1295)
- Universal Solvent
  - Renames 'Apply Glue' activity to 'Apply Solvent'. [#1276](https://github.com/foundryvtt/foundryvtt-premium-content/issues/1276)
  - Simplifies 'Determine Ounces' activity by setting the item uses to be fully spent (0/7 charges) initially and restoring 1d6 + 1 charges as a single use activity.
  - Corrects item type to 'Consumable' with Destroy on Empty.
  - Changes the template size from "number of ounces in square feet" to "1 foot square template per ounce used" to more closely match the item's usage and text.
- Perfume of Bewitching
  - Corrects item type to 'consumable'.
  - Adds advantage for listed skill checks in Active Effect.
- Assassin's Blood
  - Corrects the spelling of the unidentified name. [#1240](https://github.com/foundryvtt/foundryvtt-premium-content/issues/1240)

### Treasure
- Adds the missing thumbnail image for "Art Object (750 GP)" item. [#1132](https://github.com/foundryvtt/foundryvtt-premium-content/issues/1132)

