## Roll Tables
- Updates the roll formula in the Treasure Hordes table for the CR 0-4 row. When you click on the roll enricher, the result now displays in the chat. [#1219](https://github.com/foundryvtt/foundryvtt-premium-content/issues/1219)
- Updates the roll table for the Ring of Resistance by changing the label in row 2 to "Cold (Tourmaline)." This change cascades to the item and journal referencing the ring. [#1227](https://github.com/foundryvtt/foundryvtt-premium-content/issues/1227)

## Traps
- In addition to equipment, traps are also available as NPCs with a creature type of "Traps" and the Token Disposition of "Secret." [#963](https://github.com/foundryvtt/foundryvtt-premium-content/issues/963)

## Hazards
- All Hazard Actors have also had their Token Disposition set to "Secret".
